TYPES.md §3.3, §11.1, §15; EVALUATION.md §9.3, §13; CLI.md §3.7 (EVAL-AMENDNOTE): a default reading an earlier field through `self` is evaluated as by its bare name, in an operand, a string interpolation, through parentheses, an applied record and a case body, and is re-derived, with the amendment's layer, when a layer amends the field it reads.
-- layers --
dev
-- paths --
a:server
